          "heading": "Security and accessibility",
          "text": "Structures are read from and written to local paths, chosen through path fields with native browse buttons; a typed path and a browsed one run through the same validation. Nothing is downloaded. Every fixture, course, and range control is keyboard reachable and named, the long forms scroll rather than clipping, and coordinates use the monospaced face."
